Offline timezone lookup

@photostructure/tz-lookup is distributed under CC0-1.0:
https://github.com/photostructure/tz-lookup

Its compact timezone boundary data is derived from Evan Siroky's
timezone-boundary-builder project, whose geographic data is available under
the Open Database License (ODbL-1.0):
https://github.com/evansiroky/timezone-boundary-builder
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Timezone boundaries include OpenStreetMap data, copyright OpenStreetMap
contributors: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The lookup is approximate. Timezone offset rules are supplied by the runtime,
separately from this geographic lookup data.
